// Auto-inject contract (store.ts a0f290f): SessionStart surfaces the
// progressive-disclosure indexes — profile/MEMORY.md (global preferences)
// and project/<slug>/MEMORY.md (per-cwd decisions). Both must reach the
// agent on every harness; topic files are discovered via memory_search.
//
// CACHE-CRITICAL split by client. Pi injects the stable global profile into
// its cross-cwd cacheable base via the extension's systemPrompt:build filter
// (and before_agent_start owns the tail fallback when the filter can't place
// it), so the Pi dispatcher returns project memory ONLY — emitting profile
// here would double-inject and burst Pi's prompt cache. Claude Code and Codex
// have no such filter: this CLI dispatcher is their ONLY injection channel, so
// the profile index must ride along in their stdout (profile first, then
// project within the shared byte/file budget). Never inject inbox/raw capture
// here: it carries event ids and timestamps that change between sessions.
//
